WEBVTT

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.800
and haven't figured out how to stop.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.920
And as I get older, it does get harder.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.936
No seriously, it gets harder.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.496
(Laughter)

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.896
My mother's taught me many things, though,

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.016
most of all that love overrules.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.216
She's taught me that love

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.440
is an action,

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.536
not a feeling.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:53.016
Love is a way of being,
it's a way of doing,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.240
it's a way of listening
and it's a way of seeing.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.696
DW: And also, the idea about love,

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.240
photographers,